From 41f832ef9f808029a722164f3533e2199550205b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FiyeroT <me@fiyero.xyz>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:53:46 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 161/177] patches: adapt to sing-box 1.14.4

sing-box 1.14.4 resolves a group into the chain of outbounds the connection
is dialed through (OutboundGroup.Selected, RealTag by network) and marks
external connections explicitly. The loop check of the direct inbound takes
the last outbound of that chain; the urltest code names members by RealTag
for TCP; the rule-set download is marked external with true.
---
